    "Cost": 11169748,
    "UIName": "Sunder SD1-O 'Samual'",
    "Id": "mechdef_sunder_SD1-O_samual",
    "Name": "Sunder SD1-O",
    "Details": "The custom configuration used by MechWarrior Tanisha Brown supposedly at the direction of her commander, the Samual is equipped to wreak havoc against infantry forces. The configuration's primary weapon is six normally Inferno equipped SRM-4 launchers, three in the left arm, two in the center torso and one in the head, complemented by four Flamers, two mounted in the right arm and one in each torso, four Machine Guns in the left arm and each torso and an A-Pod in each leg. Two tons of machine gun ammo and four tons of SRM ammo allow Brown to fire nearly continuously. An ER PPC carried in the right arm is the sole concession to more heavily armored forces.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_sunder"
  },
